    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="26">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Af">Af</ref> 26</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">{XXVII} Gif mon ungewintrædne wifmon to niedhæmde geðreatige, sie ðæt swa ðæs gewintredan monnes bot.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">If someone rapes an underage girl, let the compensation be the same as for a mature person.</ab>
        <ab type="secondTranslation" xml:lang="en">If anyone rapes a girl who is not of age, the same compensation shall be paid for her as to an adult.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">XXVII. Gif mon ungewintredne wifmon to nydhæmede geðreatige, sy ðæt swa ðæs gewintredon monnes bot.</ab>
      </div>
